&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;seeking individuals who value agility, passion, and teamwork; those who can bring fresh ideas to the table and are eager to learn, grow, and advance&amp;nbsp;their careers. Bring your aptitude and build upon what you do&amp;nbsp;best&amp;nbsp;for our customers, partners, team, and you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You are tasked with bringing in new business. This means you are a creative thinker who is confident and self-motivated with an entrepreneurial mindset. You take pride in seeing your hard work pay off when you see the&amp;nbsp;final results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
